  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'richard-begay-navajo-sterling-silver-12k-gold-filled-storyteller-cuff-bracelet', '4550675351', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4550675351/richard-begay-navajo-sterling-silver-12k?click_key=EuX5FzdRggwFsk_OCl1UFY9nASa9%3ALTe6c7009d7a554bfb98158d9c308345e9bc8998c4&click_sum=e8b14b58&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1072116-18-10&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Richard Begay Navajo Sterling Silver 12K Gold Filled Storyteller Cuff Bracelet', 'Beautiful vintage Richard Begay Navajo storyteller cuff bracelet, crafted in sterling silver with 12k gold-filled applied designs. The bracelet features a textured sterling silver background accented with raised gold-filled Southwestern pictorial symbols that continue around the cuff. The contrasting siler and warm gold tones give the bracelet wonderful dimension and make the detailed storyteller design stand out. This thick silver cuff shows two different stories, one on each side making it even more unique. Width: 6.5" Opening: 1.25" Materials: Sterling Silver & 12K GF Stamped: Sterling, 1/20 12K G.F, RB (Hallmark associated with Richard Begay - Navajo silversmith Weight: 48.77 g ::Note:: All jewelry is pre-owned and vintage. This also means pieces could have minor wear & imperfections. Please feel free to contact me if you have any questions about an item or help with placing your order. We always try to represent true colors, but that being said, colors may vary on different computer screen settings vs actual product.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
