  (uuid_generate_v4(), '16-turquoise-and-10mm-navajo-style-pearls-necklace-16', '1825563288', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1825563288/16-turquoise-and-navajo-style-pearls?click_key=386bdd14-7031-41bb-872a-cd920b3f275a%3ALT434322a9ba2519ba2275af1a21ae585815558927&click_sum=1de9bcbd&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1072117-18-9&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=386bdd14-7031-41bb-872a-cd920b3f275a%253ALT434322a9ba2519ba2275af1a21ae585815558927',
   '16" Turquoise and 10mm Navajo style Pearls Necklace 16"', 'I have made this necklace using beautiful blue turquoise beads. The round 10mm navajo style Pearl beads are Hematite, a gemstone, and will never tarnish. This is 16", please check in my shop for the 18” version PLEASE look at all of the photos so that you can see the details. This set comes in a gift box and shipping is FREE! Care; I use quality components to ensure that jewelry purchased here is a good value. That being said, this piece is delicate and will not stand up to being pulled on, slept in, worn while showering, swimming, playing sports or other high impact activities. Not for children. In order to keep this looking it''s best; when not wearing, always keep in a closed jewelry box or any container that limits oxygen, moisture and light. *Important information here: if the term "Navaho pearls" is new to you, this is a special trade name for metal beads that have a blackened/oxidized surface near the holes and a silver polished stripe through the center. These are found in many different materials including Sterling silver, steel, silver plated copper or brass, hematite, and even plated plastic. Ours are hematite which I have selected due to their high quality, great value and non tarnish advantage. These should not be confused with fresh water pearls which come from a nucleated mollusk and are farmed in water. Please note - I am not Navajo and I am not claiming to be Native American, I offer these items as the STYLE that I love and want to share with you. Everything in my shop IS MADE BY ME. Please look at the reviews to see how much buyers love these for the excellent quality and great value. If I have not answered all of your questions, please use the contact feature to ask me. Thank you for looking. This link will take you to my etsy store front. https://www.etsy.com/shop/OregonJewelryGarden?ref=hdr_shop_menu', 'statement-pieces',
