  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'signed-native-america-indian-jewelry-copper-navajo-cuff-southwestern-turquoise-r', '4594535315', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4594535315/signed-native-america-indian-jewelry?click_key=EuX5FzdRggwFsk_OCl1UFY9nASa9%3ALT9024ae237da69ca8321a7911b6e27bfcd03baea7&click_sum=4f235076&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1072116-18-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1',
   'SIGNED Native America Indian Jewelry Copper Navajo Cuff Southwestern Turquoise Red Coral Kokopelli Handmade Handcrafted', 'SIGNED Vintage Native America Indian Jewelry Navajo Handcrafted Slightly Adjustable Hand Stamped Copper Cuff with Sleeping Beauty Turquoise and Red Coral. Great attention to detail Hallmarked by Navajo Artist Charlene Begaye Internal length of Bracelet is approximately 6” plus gap 1.25”total 7.25” Width is .75”average Great for a Gift ❤️ Wearing copper has several important benefits: First, copper is an essential mineral for humans, and wearing copper jewelry has the benefit of slow copper absorption- perfect for proper assimilation. It’s also been claimed that headaches, arthritis, joint pain, and zinc deficiency can be effectively treated with the aid of copper or brass jewelry.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
