  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'crazy-lace-agate-necklace-and-earring-set-copper-patina-navajo-pearls-western-je', '4580848702', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4580848702/crazy-lace-agate-necklace-and-earring?click_key=EuX5FzdRggwFsk_OCl1UFY9nASa9%3ALT50f92e30d9377cecfd8f89d9e7e7a2cdaf0297c8&click_sum=7ebac379&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-1072116-18-5&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1',
   'Crazy Lace Agate Necklace and Earring Set, Copper Patina Navajo Pearls, Western Jewelry', 'Meet Artist''s Palette, a handmade Western necklace and earring set inspired by the extraordinary mineral-painted hills of California''s Death Valley, where nature transforms the desert into a breathtaking canvas of color. Beautiful 6mm faceted crazy lace agate beads showcase an incredible variety of earthy shades, from golden yellow and creamy ivory to warm rust, sandy beige, and smoky gray. Each stone features its own intricate patterns and color variations, reminiscent of the swirling layers and colorful formations found throughout the American Southwest. Copper-tone faux Navajo pearls with a vibrant turquoise patina finish add rustic Western charm and a beautiful contrast to the natural gemstones. The combination creates a delicate, colorful design that feels both earthy and distinctive. Perfect for wearing alone or layering with your favorite Western jewelry, Artist''s Palette adds a touch of Southwestern beauty to denim, casual outfits, and everyday looks. A pair of coordinating drop earrings completes the set. Details: • Necklace length: 16" • 3" extender for adjustable fit • Genuine 6mm faceted crazy lace agate lentil beads • Copper-tone faux Navajo pearls with turquoise patina • Matching earrings included • Earring drop length: 1.6" • Handmade by Cactus & Coral Crazy lace agate is a natural gemstone, and each bead features unique colors and patterns. No two sets will look exactly alike, making every handmade piece beautifully individual. Click here to be taken to our other necklace sets: https://www.etsy.com/shop/CactusAndCoralInc?ref=seller-platform-mcnav&dd_referrer=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.etsy.com%2Fyour%2Fshops%2Fme%2Flisting-editor%2Fcopy%2F1344774936§ion_id=39622868 Join us to be notified of new releases and exclusive discounts! https://linktr.ee/cactusandcoral Thank you for stopping by. Have a blessed day! Sincerely, The Cactus and Coral Crew', 'statement-pieces',
