   'Southwestern Oxidized Sterling Silver Necklace, "Moon Rise"', 'A strand of 2mm oxidized beads accented with small clusters of 2.5mm, 3mm and 4mm beads and a 5mm bead in the center with a 2" total drop below. The beads are 100% raw Sterling silver and are oxidized right here at my shop! Necklace is clasped with your choice of a handmade S-clasp with a hammered texture or a Lobster clasp, and is extendable to 1.5 extra inches. Necklace length is measured from the tip of the clasp to the first ring on the extender, like a neck chain, not just beaded length. Comes "Gift Ready" in box with polishing cloth and care instructions. Handmade in Loveland, Colorado! Please note: Do not assume size by looking at pictures. All dimensions are given.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
