  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'davidheeshee-native-american-navajo-turquoise-sterling-silver-handmade-dainty-ne', '1773395308', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1773395308/davidheeshee-native-american-navajo?click_key=EugH2sedQ8DY96Hl5Iy7rAo3RF6b%3ALTfea4adeb5ea4466d34636abf203b8d9a24d7c08f&click_sum=2fad2f5f&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-293398-17-7&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&sts=1',
   'DAVIDHEESHEE Native American Navajo Turquoise Sterling Silver Handmade Dainty Necklace | Kingman Turquoise Jewelry', 'Native Handmade – Made by Native American artists with extraordinary gemstone cutting skills and outstanding silver crafting techniques. Attention to detail, every single piece is infused with artists’ lifetime experience of jewelry design and creation. Hand Picked – Each piece we sell is handpicked from our Native American trading resources, we made sure they meet the highest standards in terms of gemstone grades and overall jewelry quality. Gemstone Specification – 6mm Turquoise Round Center Bead, features in rich blue tone and naturally minimal patterned matrix. Made from Arizona Kingman Turquoise. Jewelry Specification – 2mm Sterling Silver Tube Beads (Liquid Silver). Sterling Silver Lobster Clasp. Necklace Length 16 inch. Trusted Source – We never source mass jewelry productions, we believe the only way to acquire the best of the best, is to examine what we source piece by piece. With our decades of experiences in jewelry and gemstone industry, plus rich resources and connections in Native American community, we are undoubtedly one of your most trusted sources for Native American Jewelries. Made in USA', 'turquoise-jewelry',
