  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'very-fine-vintage-din-navajo-carinated-ingot-sterling-silver-hand-stamped-bracel', '4593769723', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4593769723/very-fine-vintage-dine-navajo-carinated?click_key=EugH2sedQ8DY96Hl5Iy7rAo3RF6b%3ALTe03a3808309b9605880acb73d58543e0194abc01&click_sum=353fdcb3&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-72798-17-3&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1',
   'Very Fine Vintage Diné (Navajo) Carinated Ingot Sterling Silver Hand Stamped Bracelet', 'Thanks for stopping into Recovered Relics, for saying no to reproductions and yes to things that people made with with their hands. If you like what you see, follow us on the road and in the shops @recovered_relics on Instagram. Please consider looking through of the rest of our shop: https://www.etsy.com/shop/recoveredrelics We''ve been doing some buying in the West and Southwest in the past year. Taken a couple of trips, lots of new connections and buying. Iconic jewelry, textiles, and images on the way. Brining those images and pieces in from the West is important to us, some very, very fine pieces coming to market, stay close. This is a very fine vintage Diné (Navajo) carinated ingot sterling silver hand stamped bracelet. Tip to tip is 5-3/8 " and the opening is 1-1/8 ". The cuff weighs 12 grams There was no way I was going to leave these behind. Questions answered quickly and to the best of my ability. Take a look at my other picks, favorite the shop, and stay in touch!', 'turquoise-jewelry',
   145, NULL, 'https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/c34f86/8712568573/il_1588xN.8712568573_6y1t.jpg',
   ARRAY['https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/c34f86/8712568573/il_1588xN.8712568573_6y1t.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/275dbf/8664735046/il_1588xN.8664735046_ics5.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/3e2d78/8664733814/il_1588xN.8664733814_cqao.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/9898f2/8712567005/il_1588xN.8712567005_vd6b.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/47a9ee/8664732212/il_1588xN.8664732212_gzgf.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/eb6ec6/8664733540/il_1588xN.8664733540_28x9.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/2190cc/8664732436/il_1588xN.8664732436_niqd.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/400aa4/8664734426/il_1588xN.8664734426_94vj.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/71b9d6/8664732674/il_1588xN.8664732674_tqxw.jpg','https://i.etsystatic.com/6813572/r/il/d7ca33/8712567595/il_1588xN.8712567595_cqqn.jpg'],
